        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-08-04T19:12:49.055Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is what is said on the KS page</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On Steam, there is no Step 3. From within either game, you will be able to play with content from both games when they are both installed. No additional downloads or disk space is required. <strong>We will investigate cross-play support for Steam Workshop as well.</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I’m assuming this is because SoEP will have its own standalone game and it wouldn’t have Workshop support itself to begin with.</p>",
