      {
        "id": 250500,
        "name": "",
        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-01-28T16:48:02.646Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/migrantp\">@MigrantP</a></p>\n<p>Hi, I went looking for the Sentinels discord, but due to limited Google-fu, I found the Handelabra discord instead, and figured I had just as much reason to join that.  However, when I tried to post, I got a message saying “you don’t have permission to post in this server”, with a “Join Server” button; I clicked this button repeatedly, but nothing happened.  I had a “Leave server” button in the upper left hand corner of the page, suggesting that I wasn’t fully a non-member, except that when I navigated away and then back again, the server was no longer visible.  So I don’t know if this is a technical issue or what, and I hoped to request your assistance.  Since your Discord is set not to accept messages from anyone you don’t share a server with, I had to try it here instead.  And since you’re not accepting PMs here either, this was all I could think to try.</p>",
